# RAG Application using Google Gemini AI

## Live Demo
https://your-streamlit-app.streamlit.app

## Overview

This project is a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) application built with Python, Streamlit, Google Gemini AI, FAISS, LangChain, and Sentence Transformers.

The application allows users to upload a PDF document, retrieve the most relevant information using semantic search, and generate accurate answers based on the document content through Google's Gemini language model.

---

## Features

- Upload PDF documents
- Extract text from PDF files
- Generate text embeddings using Sentence Transformers
- Store embeddings using FAISS
- Perform semantic similarity search
- Retrieve the most relevant document content
- Generate context-aware responses using Google Gemini AI
- Interactive chat interface
- Maintain conversation history using Streamlit Session State

---

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- Google Gemini API
- LangChain
- LangChain Community
- Sentence Transformers
- FAISS
- NumPy
- PyPDF

