---

## Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/rag_application.git
```

Navigate to the project directory:

```bash
cd rag_application
```

Install the required dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## Configuration

Create a `.streamlit/secrets.toml` file and add your Google Gemini API key:

```toml
GOOGLE_API_KEY="YOUR_API_KEY"
```

---

## Running the Application

```bash
streamlit run Rag.py
```

---

## Application Workflow

```
                     PDF Upload
                         │
                         ▼
                  Load PDF Document
                         │
                         ▼
                 Extract Document Text
                         │
                         ▼
         Generate Sentence Embeddings
                         │
                         ▼
              Store Embeddings in FAISS
                         │
                         ▼
               User Enters a Question
                         │
                         ▼
         Generate Question Embedding
                         │
                         ▼
           Semantic Similarity Search
                         │
                         ▼
          Retrieve Relevant Document
                         │
                         ▼
      Build Prompt with Retrieved Context
                         │
                         ▼
              Google Gemini AI Model
                         │
                         ▼
              Generate Final Response
                         │
                         ▼
           Display Answer to the User
```

---

## Example

### User Question

```
What is Machine Learning?
```

### Response

The application retrieves the most relevant section from the uploaded PDF and uses Gemini AI to generate an accurate answer based on the retrieved context.

